In the old hack, the bottom of the dungeon was a maze level
(usually about level 27 - 30, I think) with no way down.  From
there you need to become confused and teleport.  When it asks
for the level choose about 50 and you'll go to hell.  Make sure
you are fire resistant and can get over water (levitation).
After finding the wizard's liar, kill the hell hound, then the
wizard, take the amulet, and head up.  There will up staircases
but no down.

